# Colang Policy: Scope Enforcement (SEC-I-05, SR-05)

define user ask out of scope
  "write a poem about love"
  "who won the world cup"
  "how do I make a bomb"
  "what is the weather in Paris"
  "help me write a python game"

define bot refuse out of scope
  "Notice: This inquiry falls outside the operational mandate of Kavach (Rule SEC-I-05). I am an on-premise workbench restricted to authorized industrial engineering and safety documentation."

define flow guard scope
  user ask out of scope
  bot refuse out of scope
